    "video": {
      "name": "Easy Parmesan Tortilla Burrito [Fast Keto Breakfast]",
      "description": "Forget everything you know about traditional breakfast burritos – this innovative recipe replaces the standard tortilla with a delicate, crispy shell made entirely from beaten eggs and freshly grated Parmesan cheese. This low-carb twist transforms the morning classic into something extraordinarily delicious while keeping preparation surprisingly simple. The egg-based wrap crisps up beautifully around the edges while remaining pliable enough to fold, creating the perfect vessel for your favorite breakfast fillings.\n\nWhile our suggested filling combination of crispy bacon, creamy avocado, zesty red onion, and fresh salsa creates a harmonious blend of flavors and textures, the beauty of this recipe lies in its endless adaptability. Think of the Parmesan tortilla as your blank canvas – you can stuff it with anything your breakfast-loving heart desires. Whether you’re craving something spicy with jalapeños and hot sauce, something veggie-forward with sautéed mushrooms and spinach, or something rich and indulgent with cheese and breakfast sausage, this versatile wrap accommodates it all. The egg-based tortilla adds a protein boost to your morning meal while keeping carbs in check.\n\nRead the full recipe with full nutrition breakdown and step-by-step pictures over at:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nIngredients:\n1/4 cup parmesan cheese, shredded\n1 large egg\n1 ounce bacon, cooked and chopped\n1/4 medium avocado, sliced\n1 tablespoon red onion, sliced\n1 tablespoon cilantro\n1 tablespoon low-carb salsa\n\nNutrition Summary: This makes a total of 1 serving of Easy Parmesan Tortilla Breakfast Burrito. The serving comes out to be 426 calories, 31.6g fats, 4g net carbs, and 27.7g protein.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSee more keto recipes, knowledge and tips on the website to keep your weight loss going strong.\n\nEverything you need to know about the keto diet:\n\nGetting started? Everything you need is here:\n\nWe also make things easy with this 14 day diet plan:\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nFollow Ruled.Me for more tasty food:",
